{"suttaId":"thi-ap28","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[9425,9716],"vripara":"314"},"segments":{"thi-ap28:0.3":"Yasodharātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap28:1.1":"Ekasmiṃ samaye ramme, iddhe rājagahe pure;","thi-ap28:1.3":"Pabbhāramhi varekamhi, vasante naranāyake.","thi-ap28:2.1":"Vasantiyā tamhi nagare, ramme bhikkhunupassaye;","thi-ap28:2.3":"Yasodharābhikkhuniyā, evaṃ āsi vitakkitaṃ.","thi-ap28:3.1":"“Suddhodano mahārājā, gotamī ca pajāpatī;","thi-ap28:3.3":"Abhiññātā mahātherā, theriyo ca mahiddhikā.","thi-ap28:4.1":"“Santiṃ gatāva āsuṃ te, dīpaccīva nirāsavā;","thi-ap28:4.3":"Lokanāthe dharanteva, ahampi ca sivaṃ padaṃ.","thi-ap28:5.1":"“Gamissāmīti cintetvā, passantī āyumattano;","thi-ap28:5.3":"Passitvā āyusaṅkhāraṃ, tadaheva khayaṃ gataṃ.","thi-ap28:6.1":"“Pattacīvaramādāya, nikkhamitvā sakassamā;","thi-ap28:6.3":"Purakkhatā bhikkhunībhi, satehi sahassehi sā [saha pañcahi (sī. pī.)].","thi-ap28:7.1":"“Mahiddhikā mahāpaññā, sambuddhaṃ upasaṅkami;","thi-ap28:7.3":"Sambuddhaṃ abhivādetvā, satthuno cakkalakkhaṇe;","thi-ap28:7.5":"Nisinnā ekamantamhi, idaṃ vacanamabravi.","thi-ap28:8.1":"“‘Aṭṭhasattativassāhaṃ, pacchimo vattate vayo [pacchimā vattayi vayā (syā.)];","thi-ap28:8.3":"Pabbhāramhi anuppattā, ārocemi mahāmuni.","thi-ap28:9.1":"“‘Paripakko vayo mayhaṃ, parittaṃ mama jīvitaṃ;","thi-ap28:9.3":"Pahāya vo gamissāmi, kataṃ me saraṇamattano.","thi-ap28:10.1":"“‘Vayamhi pacchime kāle, maraṇaṃ uparuddhati;","thi-ap28:10.3":"Ajjarattiṃ mahāvīra, pāpuṇissāmi nibbutiṃ.","thi-ap28:11.1":"“‘Natthi jāti jarā byādhi, maraṇañca mahāmune;","thi-ap28:11.3":"Ajarāmaraṇaṃ puraṃ, gamissāmi asaṅkhataṃ.","thi-ap28:12.1":"“‘Yāvatā parisā nāma, samupāsanti satthuno;","thi-ap28:12.3":"Aparādhamajānantī [sace metthi (sī.), pajānantī (ka.)], khamantaṃ sammukhā mune.","thi-ap28:13.1":"“‘Saṃsaritvā ca saṃsāre, khalitañce mamaṃ tayi;","thi-ap28:13.3":"Ārocemi mahāvīra, aparādhaṃ khamassu me’.","thi-ap28:14.1":"“Sutvāna vacanaṃ tassā, munindo idamabravi;","thi-ap28:14.3":"‘Kimuttaraṃ te vakkhāmi, nibbānāya vajantiyā.","thi-ap28:15.1":"“‘Iddhiñcāpi nidassehi, mama sāsanakārike;","thi-ap28:15.3":"Parisānañca sabbāsaṃ, kaṅkhaṃ chindassu yāvatā’.","thi-ap28:16.1":"“Sutvā taṃ munino vācaṃ, bhikkhunī sā yasodharā;","thi-ap28:16.3":"Vanditvā munirājaṃ taṃ, idaṃ vacanamabravi.","thi-ap28:17.1":"“‘Yasodharā ahaṃ vīra, agāre te pajāpati;","thi-ap28:17.3":"Sākiyamhi kule jātā, itthiaṅge patiṭṭhitā.","thi-ap28:18.1":"“‘Thīnaṃ satasahassānaṃ, navutīnaṃ chaduttari;","thi-ap28:18.3":"Agāre te ahaṃ vīra, pāmokkhā sabbā issarā.","thi-ap28:19.1":"“‘Rūpācāraguṇūpetā, yobbanaṭṭhā piyaṃvadā;","thi-ap28:19.3":"Sabbā maṃ apacāyanti, devatā viya mānusā.","thi-ap28:20.1":"“‘Kaññāsatasahassapamukhā, sakyaputtanivesane;","thi-ap28:20.3":"Samānasukhadukkhatā, devatā viya nandane.","thi-ap28:21.1":"“‘Kāmadhātumatikkamma [kāmadhātumatikkantā (sī. syā. pī. ka.)], saṇṭhitā rūpadhātuyā;","thi-ap28:21.3":"Rūpena sadisā natthi, ṭhapetvā lokanāyakaṃ.","thi-ap28:22.1":"“‘Sambuddhaṃ abhivādetvā, iddhiṃ dassesi satthuno;","thi-ap28:22.3":"Nekā nānāvidhākārā, mahāiddhīpi dassayī [evamādīni vatvāna, upatitvāna ambaraṃ; iddhī anekā dassesi, buddhānuññā yasodharā;(sī.)].","thi-ap28:23.1":"“‘Cakkavāḷasamaṃ kāyaṃ, sīsaṃ uttarato kuru;","thi-ap28:23.3":"Ubho pakkhā duve dīpā, jambudīpaṃ sarīrato.","thi-ap28:24.1":"“‘Dakkhiṇañca saraṃ piñchaṃ, nānāsākhā tu pattakā;","thi-ap28:24.3":"Candañca sūriyañcakkhi, merupabbatato sikhaṃ.","thi-ap28:25.1":"“‘Cakkavālagiriṃ tuṇḍaṃ, jamburukkhaṃ samūlakaṃ;","thi-ap28:25.3":"Bījamānā upāgantvā, vandantī lokanāyakaṃ.","thi-ap28:26.1":"“‘Hatthivaṇṇaṃ tathevassaṃ, pabbataṃ jaladhiṃ tathā;","thi-ap28:26.3":"Candimaṃ sūriyaṃ meruṃ, sakkavaṇṇañca dassayi.","thi-ap28:27.1":"“‘Yasodharā ahaṃ vīra, pāde vandāmi cakkhuma;","thi-ap28:27.3":"Sahassalokadhātūnaṃ, phullapadmena chādayi.","thi-ap28:28.1":"“‘Brahmavaṇṇañca māpetvā, dhammaṃ desesi suññataṃ;","thi-ap28:28.3":"Yasodharā ahaṃ vīra, pāde vandāmi cakkhuma.","thi-ap28:29.1":"“‘Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap28:29.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī homi mahāmuni.","thi-ap28:30.1":"“‘Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap28:30.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap28:31.1":"“‘Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap28:31.3":"Ñāṇaṃ mayhaṃ mahāvīra, uppannaṃ tava santike.","thi-ap28:32.1":"“‘Pubbānaṃ lokanāthānaṃ, saṅgamaṃ te nidassitaṃ [sudassitaṃ (syā. pī. ka.)];","thi-ap28:32.3":"Adhikāraṃ bahuṃ mayhaṃ, tuyhatthāya mahāmune.","thi-ap28:33.1":"“‘Yaṃ mayhaṃ pūritaṃ kammaṃ, kusalaṃ sarase mune;","thi-ap28:33.3":"Tuyhatthāya mahāvīra, puññaṃ upacitaṃ mayā.","thi-ap28:34.1":"“‘Abhabbaṭṭhāne vajjetvā, vārayitvā anācaraṃ;","thi-ap28:34.3":"Tuyhatthāya mahāvīra, sañcattaṃ jīvitaṃ mayā.","thi-ap28:35.1":"“‘Nekakoṭisahassāni, bhariyatthāyadāsi maṃ;","thi-ap28:35.3":"Na tattha vimanā homi, tuyhatthāya mahāmuni.","thi-ap28:36.1":"“‘Nekakoṭisahassāni, upakārāyadāsi maṃ;","thi-ap28:36.3":"Na tattha vimanā homi, tuyhatthāya mahāmuni.","thi-ap28:37.1":"“‘Nekakoṭisahassāni, bhojanatthāyadāsi maṃ;","thi-ap28:37.3":"Na tattha vimanā homi, tuyhatthāya mahāmuni.","thi-ap28:38.1":"“‘Nekakoṭisahassāni, jīvitāni pariccajiṃ;","thi-ap28:38.3":"Bhayamokkhaṃ karissanti, dadāmi mama jīvitaṃ.","thi-ap28:39.1":"“‘Aṅgagate [aṅge evaṃ (ka.)] alaṅkāre, vatthe nānāvidhe bahū;","thi-ap28:39.3":"Itthimaṇḍe na gūhāmi, tuyhatthāya mahāmuni.","thi-ap28:40.1":"“‘Dhanadhaññapariccāgaṃ, gāmāni nigamāni ca;","thi-ap28:40.3":"Khettaṃ puttā ca dhītā ca, pariccattā mahāmuni.","thi-ap28:41.1":"“‘Hatthī assā gavā cāpi, dāsiyo paricārikā;","thi-ap28:41.3":"Tuyhatthāya mahāvīra, pariccattā asaṅkhiyā.","thi-ap28:42.1":"“‘Yaṃ mayhaṃ paṭimantesi [patimantesi (sī.)], dānaṃ dassāmi yācake;","thi-ap28:42.3":"Vimanaṃ me na passāmi, dadato dānamuttamaṃ.","thi-ap28:43.1":"“‘Nānāvidhaṃ bahuṃ dukkhaṃ, saṃsāre ca bahubbidhe;","thi-ap28:43.3":"Tuyhatthāya mahāvīra, anubhuttaṃ asaṅkhiyaṃ.","thi-ap28:44.1":"“‘Sukhappattānumodāmi, na ca dukkhesu dummanā;","thi-ap28:44.3":"Sabbattha tulitā homi, tuyhatthāya mahāmuni.","thi-ap28:45.1":"“‘Anumaggena sambuddho, yaṃ dhammaṃ abhinīhari;","thi-ap28:45.3":"Anubhotvā sukhaṃ dukkhaṃ, patto bodhiṃ mahāmuni.","thi-ap28:46.1":"“‘Brahmadevañca sambuddhaṃ, gotamaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","thi-ap28:46.3":"Aññesaṃ lokanāthānaṃ, saṅgamaṃ te bahuṃ mayā.","thi-ap28:47.1":"“‘Adhikāraṃ bahuṃ mayhaṃ, tuyhatthāya mahāmuni;","thi-ap28:47.3":"Gavesato buddhadhamme, ahaṃ te paricārikā.","thi-ap28:48.1":"“‘Kappe ca satasahasse, caturo ca asaṅkhiye;","thi-ap28:48.3":"Dīpaṅkaro mahāvīro, uppajji lokanāyako.","thi-ap28:49.1":"“‘Paccantadesavisaye, nimantetvā tathāgataṃ;","thi-ap28:49.3":"Tassa āgamanaṃ maggaṃ, sodhenti tuṭṭhamānasā.","thi-ap28:50.1":"“‘Tena kālena so āsi, sumedho nāma brāhmaṇo;","thi-ap28:50.3":"Maggañca paṭiyādesi, āyato [āyataṃ (sī.)] sabbadassino.","thi-ap28:51.1":"“‘Tena kālenahaṃ āsiṃ, kaññā brāhmaṇasambhavā;","thi-ap28:51.3":"Sumittānāma nāmena, upagacchiṃ samāgamaṃ.","thi-ap28:52.1":"“‘Aṭṭha uppalahatthāni, pūjanatthāya satthuno;","thi-ap28:52.3":"Ādāya janasaṃmajjhe, addasaṃ isi muggataṃ.","thi-ap28:53.1":"“‘Cirānugataṃ dayitaṃ [cirānupari āsīnaṃ (sī.)], atikkantaṃ manoharaṃ;","thi-ap28:53.3":"Disvā tadā amaññissaṃ, saphalaṃ jīvitaṃ mama.","thi-ap28:54.1":"“‘Parakkamaṃ taṃ saphalaṃ, addasaṃ isino tadā;","thi-ap28:54.3":"Pubbakammena sambuddhe, cittañcāpi pasīdi me.","thi-ap28:55.1":"“‘Bhiyyo cittaṃ pasādesiṃ, ise uggatamānase;","thi-ap28:55.3":"Deyyaṃ aññaṃ na passāmi, demi pupphāni te isi.","thi-ap28:56.1":"“‘Pañcahatthā tava hontu, tayo hontu mamaṃ ise;","thi-ap28:56.3":"Tena saddhiṃ samā hontu, bodhatthāya tavaṃ ise’.","thi-ap28:57.1":"Catutthaṃ bhāṇavāraṃ.","thi-ap28:58.1":"“Isi gahetvā pupphāni, āgacchantaṃ mahāyasaṃ;","thi-ap28:58.3":"Pūjesi janasaṃmajjhe, bodhatthāya mahāisi.","thi-ap28:59.1":"“Passitvā janasaṃmajjhe, dīpaṅkaro mahāmuni;","thi-ap28:59.3":"Viyākāsi mahāvīro, isi muggatamānasaṃ.","thi-ap28:60.1":"“Aparimeyye ito kappe, dīpaṅkaro mahāmuni;","thi-ap28:60.3":"Mama kammaṃ viyākāsi, ujubhāvaṃ mahāmuni.","thi-ap28:61.1":"“‘Samacittā samakammā, samakārī bhavissati;","thi-ap28:61.3":"Piyā hessati kammena, tuyhatthāya mahāisi [mahāise (syā.)].","thi-ap28:62.1":"“‘Sudassanā supiyā ca, manāpā piyavādinī;","thi-ap28:62.3":"Tassa dhammesu dāyādā, viharissati iddhikā.","thi-ap28:63.1":"“‘Yathāpi bhaṇḍasāmuggaṃ, anurakkhati sāmino;","thi-ap28:63.3":"Evaṃ kusaladhammānaṃ, anurakkhissate ayaṃ.","thi-ap28:64.1":"“‘Tassa te [tassa taṃ (syā.)] anukampantī, pūrayissati pāramī;","thi-ap28:64.3":"Sīhova pañjaraṃ bhetvā [hitvā (syā.), hetvā (pī.)], pāpuṇissati bodhiyaṃ’.","thi-ap28:65.1":"“Aparimeyye ito kappe, yaṃ maṃ buddho viyākarī;","thi-ap28:65.3":"Taṃ vācaṃ anumodentī, evaṃkārī bhaviṃ ahaṃ.","thi-ap28:66.1":"“Tassa kammassa sukatassa, tattha cittaṃ pasādayiṃ;","thi-ap28:66.3":"Devamanussakaṃ yoniṃ, anubhotvā asaṅkhiyaṃ.","thi-ap28:67.1":"“Sukhadukkhenubhotvāhaṃ, devesu mānusesu ca;","thi-ap28:67.3":"Pacchime bhave sampatte, ajāyiṃ sākiye kule.","thi-ap28:68.1":"“Rūpavatī bhogavatī, yasasīlavatī tato;","thi-ap28:68.3":"Sabbaṅgasampadā homi, kulesu abhisakkatā.","thi-ap28:69.1":"“Lābhaṃ silokaṃ sakkāraṃ, lokadhammasamāgamaṃ;","thi-ap28:69.3":"Cittañca dukkhitaṃ natthi, vasāmi akutobhayā.","thi-ap28:70.1":"“Vuttañhetaṃ bhagavatā, rañño antepure tadā;","thi-ap28:70.3":"Khattiyānaṃ pure vīra, upakārañca niddisi.","thi-ap28:71.1":"“Upakārā ca yā nārī, yā ca nārī sukhe dukhe;","thi-ap28:71.3":"Atthakkhāyī ca yā nārī, yā ca nārīnukampikā.","thi-ap28:72.1":"“Pañcakoṭisatā buddhā, navakoṭisatāni ca;","thi-ap28:72.3":"Etesaṃ devadevānaṃ, mahādānaṃ pavattayiṃ.","thi-ap28:73.1":"“Adhikāraṃ mahā [sadā (pī.) evamuparipi] mayhaṃ, dhammarāja suṇohi me;","thi-ap28:73.3":"Ekādasakoṭisatā, buddhā dvādasa koṭiyo [honti lokagganāyakā (sī. syā.), paṇṇākoṭisatāni ca (pī.)].","thi-ap28:74.1":"“Etesaṃ devadevānaṃ, mahādānaṃ pavattayiṃ;","thi-ap28:74.3":"Adhikāraṃ mahā mayhaṃ, dhammarāja suṇohi me.","thi-ap28:75.1":"“‘Vīsakoṭisatā buddhā, tiṃsakoṭisatāni ca;","thi-ap28:75.3":"Etesaṃ devadevānaṃ, mahādānaṃ pavattayiṃ.","thi-ap28:76.1":"“‘Adhikāraṃ mahā mayhaṃ, dhammarāja suṇohi me;","thi-ap28:76.3":"Cattālīsakoṭisatā, paññāsa koṭisatāni ca.","thi-ap28:77.1":"“‘Etesaṃ devadevānaṃ, mahādānaṃ pavattayiṃ;","thi-ap28:77.3":"Adhikāraṃ mahā mayhaṃ, dhammarāja suṇohi me.","thi-ap28:78.1":"“‘Saṭṭhikoṭisatā buddhā, sattatikoṭisatāni ca;","thi-ap28:78.3":"Etesaṃ devadevānaṃ, mahādānaṃ pavattayiṃ.","thi-ap28:79.1":"“‘Adhikāraṃ mahā mayhaṃ, dhammarāja suṇohi me;","thi-ap28:79.3":"Asītikoṭisatā buddhā, navutikoṭisatāni ca.","thi-ap28:80.1":"“‘Etesaṃ devadevānaṃ, mahādānaṃ pavattayiṃ;","thi-ap28:80.3":"Adhikāraṃ mahā mayhaṃ, dhammarāja suṇohi me.","thi-ap28:81.1":"“‘Koṭisatasahassāni, honti lokagganāyakā;","thi-ap28:81.3":"Etesaṃ devadevānaṃ, mahādānaṃ pavattayiṃ.","thi-ap28:82.1":"“‘Adhikāraṃ mahā mayhaṃ, dhammarāja suṇohi me;","thi-ap28:82.3":"Navakoṭisahassāni, apare lokanāyakā.","thi-ap28:83.1":"“‘Etesaṃ devadevānaṃ, mahādānaṃ pavattayiṃ;","thi-ap28:83.3":"Adhikāraṃ mahā mayhaṃ, dhammarāja suṇohi me.","thi-ap28:84.1":"“‘Koṭisatasahassāni, pañcāsītimahesinaṃ;","thi-ap28:84.3":"Pañcāsītikoṭisatā, sattatiṃsā ca koṭiyo.","thi-ap28:85.1":"“‘Etesaṃ devadevānaṃ, mahādānaṃ pavattayiṃ;","thi-ap28:85.3":"Adhikāraṃ mahā mayhaṃ, dhammarāja suṇohi me.","thi-ap28:86.1":"“‘Paccekabuddhā vītarāgā [dhutarāgā (pī. ka.)], aṭṭhaṭṭhamakakoṭiyo [aṭṭhamattaka …(sī.), aṭṭhamatthaka …(syā.)];","thi-ap28:86.3":"Adhikāraṃ mahā mayhaṃ, dhammarāja suṇohi me.","thi-ap28:87.1":"“‘Khīṇāsavā vītamalā, asaṅkhiyā buddhasāvakā;","thi-ap28:87.3":"Adhikāraṃ mahā mayhaṃ, dhammarāja suṇohi me.","thi-ap28:88.1":"“‘Evaṃ dhamme suciṇṇānaṃ, sadā dhammassa cārinaṃ;","thi-ap28:88.3":"Dhammacārī sukhaṃ seti, asmiṃ loke paramhi ca.","thi-ap28:89.1":"“‘Dhammaṃ care sucaritaṃ, na naṃ duccaritaṃ care;","thi-ap28:89.3":"Dhammacārī sukhaṃ seti, asmiṃ loke paramhi ca.","thi-ap28:90.1":"“‘Nibbinditvāna saṃsāre, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap28:90.3":"Sahassaparivārena, pabbajitvā akiñcanā.","thi-ap28:91.1":"“‘Agāraṃ vijahitvāna, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap28:91.3":"Aḍḍhamāse asampatte, catusaccamapāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap28:92.1":"“‘Cīvaraṃ piṇḍapātañca, paccayaṃ sayanāsanaṃ;","thi-ap28:92.3":"Upanenti bahū janā, sāgareyeva ūmiyo.","thi-ap28:93.1":"“‘Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap28:94.1":"“‘Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap28:95.1":"“‘Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ’.","thi-ap28:96.1":"“Evaṃ bahuvidhaṃ dukkhaṃ, sampattī ca bahubbidhā;","thi-ap28:96.3":"Visuddhibhāvaṃ sampattā, labhāmi sabbasampadā.","thi-ap28:97.1":"“Yā dadāti sakattānaṃ, puññatthāya mahesino;","thi-ap28:97.3":"Sahāyasampadā honti, nibbānapadamasaṅkhataṃ.","thi-ap28:98.1":"“Parikkhīṇaṃ atītañca, paccuppannaṃ anāgataṃ;","thi-ap28:98.3":"Sabbakammaṃ mamaṃ khīṇaṃ, pāde vandāmi cakkhuma”.","thi-ap28:99.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ yasodharā bhikkhunī bhagavato sammukhā imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap28:100.1":"Yasodharātheriyāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
